## 4. Host Discovery & Sanity Checks

Before applying Kubernetes manifests, verify that the SAN emulator has provisioned the required FC target paths on the
node:

```bash
# Inspect SAN target status and device mappings
fc-san-ctl status

# Verify by-path device presence
ls -la /dev/disk/by-path/*fc*
```

